      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just noticed something kinda weird with my vision. like in my left eye there are these tiny dark spots floating around and it feels like there is a shadow or a curtain right at the edge of what i can see. it's kinda scary but i have a huge presentation tomorrow and i really dont want to go to the er if it's nothing. do u think it could just be eye strain from too much screen time??",
